WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.214
Rachel: Look, Dad! There's Ricky!

2
00:00:11.215 --> 00:00:17.895
Dad: Why is he chasing those boys?

3
00:00:17.896 --> 00:00:22.083
Spike: Ouch! Hey, that hurt!

4
00:00:22.084 --> 00:00:30.734
Dad: Ricky! What's the matter with you?

5
00:00:30.735 --> 00:00:35.279
Dad: I don't like how you behaved today.

6
00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:42.822
Ricky: But Spike took my ball and he . . .

7
00:00:42.823 --> 00:00:47.492
Dad: Will chasing and pushing him solve the problem?

8
00:00:47.493 --> 00:00:50.943
Ricky: No, not really.

9
00:00:50.944 --> 00:00:54.608
Dad: What would be a better way?

10
00:00:54.609 --> 00:01:04.409
Ricky: Try to ignore him. Try to be nice.

11
00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:06.941
Brian: Where are we going, Ricky?

12
00:01:06.942 --> 00:01:11.249
Ricky: I have to apologize to someone.

13
00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:18.149
Hopper: Is that your grandpa's jacket, Spike?

14
00:01:18.150 --> 00:01:25.407
Ricky: Hey, Spike, here's your jacket.

15
00:01:25.408 --> 00:01:28.475
Ricky: And I'm sorry about yesterday.

16
00:01:28.476 --> 00:01:31.879
Spike: Uh, that's okay.

17
00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:37.196
Brian: Wow, you're really nice, Ricky.

